@baseUrl = http://localhost:8888
@token = replace-with-jwt
@buildingId = replace-with-building-uuid
@taskId = replace-with-task-uuid

### 创建任务
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inspection-tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"buildingId":"{{buildingId}}","inspectionType":"ROUTINE","title":"现场安全巡检"}

### 开始任务
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inspection-tasks/{{taskId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
